(text "12 V input, eFuse, PMBus core regulator, current shunt, socket VCORE; fixed 1.8 V I/O.\nCore/I/O telemetry; Pico USB control; 12+12 capacitor population; hardware power shutdown latch and STOP.\nValid VIO: reset defaults released; explicit button/ZedBoard/Pico reset only. PG and VIN12_VALID are monitors." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "8c2f7ef6-4d0e-53c1-b685-a78056665b72"))
